cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "The Knowledge Press: The Disulfides"
abstract: >
  The Disulfides is the third edition of The Knowledge Press. It reads the
  proteusPy disulfide database: a browser-based 3-D orchard in which every
  structural class is a tree, grown from the classes' torsions, in groves
  by class family, with the consensus model disulfide of each class
  standing as its representative. Built from The Knowledge Press: The
  Family, itself built from The Knowledge Press (The Forest).
